 * Every project in one list, in order of importance: selected work, then more projects. Only the
 * home page splits them under two headings.
 *
 * File Structure:
 * - One list of project cards
 *
 * Where this file is used within the repository:
 * - Route: /projects
 *
 * Usage:
 * $ `npm run dev` : Renders in the local development server
